    "Four numeric submissions had an actual float-rounding defect despite green own tests. Correct source was landed; failures remain preserved.",
    "Both guide drafts passed structural checks but needed semantic precision corrections. One repaired draft was landed.",
    "Self-authored test mistakes consumed substantial model work, including nonexistent unittest.parametrize, bool subclassing, wrong error expectations and numeric boundary assumptions. Tests sometimes reinforced an implementation mistake; independent checks remain necessary.",
    "The guide receipt arm actually used automatic file-delta facts exposed after a context reset; this is qualitative usefulness, not measured reviewer acceleration.",
    "The documentation evaluator was changed from a quadratic diff to a linear preservation check before model runs; sealed-reference check time fell from9.407s to0.035s."
  ],
  "limitations": [
